                        "entry_id": "f2d90485-3e18-3dec-af46-07661fb6f42d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "inconsolable"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07f323c5-5bca-4fba-a51b-fc2b58ce33a9",
                                "sense_id": "c00fccc8-4acb-3a96-be42-4ac20e5a0ef3",
                                "text": "Очеви́дно бы́ло, что Саве́льич пе́редо мно́ю был прав и что я напра́сно оскорби́л его́ упрёком и подозре́нием. Я проси́л у него́ проще́ния; но стари́к был неуте́шен.",
                                "translation": "Savelitch was evidently guiltless, and I had incautiously hurt him by my reproaches and suspicions. I begged his pardon, but the old man was inconsolable.",
                                "english": "Savelitch was evidently guiltless, and I had incautiously hurt him by my reproaches and suspicions. I begged his pardon, but the old man was inconsolable."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
